  "content": "\n\n<br>\n<center>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/191156564623444064-10-15-2020-1602790182.png\" alt=\"未定義\" />\n</center>\n<br>\n\n<center>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/u6CVJrc\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/223938153260515328.svg?color=7289DA&amp;label=discord&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=FFFFFF&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Modding Legacy Discord 伺服器\" /></a> <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/moddinglegacy\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ko--fi-support-FF5E5B?style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"如果您喜歡我們的創作，請考慮在 Ko-fi 上支持我們！謝謝！\" /></a> <a href=\"https://neoforged.net\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/BUILT_WITH-NEOFORGE-d7742f?style=for-the-badge&logo=neoforge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"基於 NeoForge 開發\" /></a>\n</center>\n<br>\n<center>\n<a href=\"https://twitter.com/ModdingLegacy\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/ModdingLegacy?style=social\" alt=\"追蹤我們！ModdingLegacy Twitter\" /></a> <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/moddinglegacy.com\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/moddinglegacy.com-0285FF?logo=bluesky&logoColor=00&style=social\" alt=\"追蹤我們！moddinglegacy.com Bluesky\" /></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/channel/UCUhDvKdbaKHrKvV5kcKqqiQ\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCUhDvKdbaKHrKvV5kcKqqiQ?sub_confirmation=1&style=social&label=@ModdingLegacy\" alt=\"在 YouTube 上訂閱我們！\" /></a>\n</center>\n<br>\n\n<center>\n  <b>\n    一個簡單的模組，讓馬匹可以裝備終界箱。\n  </b>\n</center>\n\n<hr />\n<br>\n\n<h2>🐴 摘要</h2>\n本模組僅允許任何馬匹裝備終界箱。這讓玩家能夠隨時隨地開啟自己的終界箱。只要其他模組的實作方式正確，終界箱甚至能顯示在模組新增的馬匹身上！<br><br>\n\n<br>\n<center>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/201007192748742768-10-15-2020-1602791378.png\" alt=\"騎乘\" />\n</center>\n<br>\n<br>\n<center>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/709021337770268467-10-15-2020-1602791296.png\" alt=\"介面\" />\n</center>\n<br>\n<h2>🧪 模組相容性</h2>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wings-horns-hooves-the-ultimate-unicorn-mod\">Good Night's Sleep</a> -- <strong>相容</strong>。<br><br>\n\n此模組新增了獨角獸，並與 Ender Chested 完美相容。<br><br>\n\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wings-horns-hooves-the-ultimate-unicorn-mod\">Wings Horns &amp; Hooves, the Ultimate Unicorn Mod</a> -- <strong>相容</strong>。<br><br>\n\n該功能運作正常，但您需要對其自訂馬匹按下 <em>SHIFT + 右鍵</em>，因為它們的介面會覆蓋 Ender Chested 的設定。<br><br>\n\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/realistic-horse-genetics\">Realistic Horse Genetics</a> -- <strong>相容</strong>，但存在瑕疵。<br><br>\n\n其基本功能如預期運作，但終界箱無法在其馬匹模型上正確渲染。<br><hr />\n<br>\n\n<span><strong>🤚 支援：如果您對我們的模組有任何疑問或遇到問題，請先閱讀常見問題解答（FAQ）！您也可以透過 <a href=\"https://gitlab.com/groups/modding-legacy/-/issues\">提交問題追蹤單</a>，或加入我們的 Discord 伺服器，我們將為您提供協助！</strong></span>\n<br><br>\n\n<center>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/u6CVJrc\"><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/223938153260515328/widget.png?style=banner3\" alt=\"Modding Legacy Discord 伺服器\" /></a>\n</center>\n<br>",
